text = "You can double click on a potion to break it.

You can press R to refresh potion offers in the shop.

Look to the bottom left for a health bar.

Lava is hot.

Press I to open and close the hintbook.

When the recipe book is unlocked, press A, D, or the left or right arrow keys to switch pages."

