text = "Look at the colors of the mushrooms for a clue to a hidden location.

You can use gold apples or berries to replace ingredients in a potion with three of the same ingredients.
You can sell these potions instead of the regular variants for more coins.

You can click on the potions on the store's desk to sell them."
